{"about_the_game":"Based on the popular watermelon game, welcome: Melon Madness!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCombine fruit together to score points, strategize to maximize your space, and don't let any fruit out of the box. The more fruit you combine the more points you rack up. Take over the leaderboards and challenge your friends!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHave an extra controller?<br />\r\nUsing two controllers, you can play with your friends in local COOP, 1v1 your friends to see who is really the master!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay in different game-modes to spice up the fun!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nClassic: For what you've come to expect<br />\r\nReverse: An interesting twist where you have to drop the big fruit first<br />\r\nBomb Attack: You have to deal with exploding fruit if you don't combine them fast enough<br />\r\nDouble: Challenge yourself by playing two boards at once","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cherry on Top","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2781960/7c2612f5e14e539bb953896306aff9e56b629516.jpg"},{"name":"Pomtastic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2781960/cf7b65774e398d753d67ba263542755085197c1f.jpg"},{"name":"An Apple a Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2781960/a500730acd30a577a3fc773b67827cb6872d8698.jpg"},{"name":"Feeling Peachy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2781960/96d0da13b3ab50dae2d892689dd2281f22f4a43e.jpg"},{"name":"Dragon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2781960/884671d7ca51cec243a074393d43c5da33d1d711.jpg"},{"name":"The DEW","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2781960/65c1fde97fa881a8a3fc0fcce0e16516e9e7a986.jpg"},{"name":"\u30b9\u30a4\u30ab","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2781960/9320e5d2f60c3b3d6d05534ee442b80cc1514989.jpg"},{"name":"Shoo